# Formspree form id for the project inquiry form (Contact page).
#
# 1. Create a form at https://formspree.io with btbnweb@gmail.com as the recipient.
# 2. Copy the form id from its endpoint (https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX → XXXXXXXX).
# 3. Put it in a local `.env` file (not committed) and in your host's env settings.
#
# This id is NOT a secret: Formspree is designed to receive it from browser code and
# restricts submissions to the domains you allow in its dashboard. Never put a
# Formspree API key or any other private credential in a VITE_* variable — anything
# prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the public bundle.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
